---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "What We Can Do For You"
description: "Manchester LMC provides confidential, expert support for GPs and practice staff — GMC investigations, CQC visits, employment matters, and more."
mainClass: page-support
showDisclaimer: true
---

  <!-- ── Page Hero ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="page-hero" aria-label="Page header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-hero-content">
        {% set breadcrumbs = [{label: "Support"}] %}
        {% include "partials/breadcrumb.njk" %}
        <h1>What We Can Do For You</h1>
        <p>Confidential, expert support for GPs and practice staff across Manchester — whatever the challenge, we're in your corner.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Intro ──────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="intro-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="support-intro">
        <h2 id="intro-heading" class="sr-only">About our support services</h2>
        <p class="support-intro-lead">
          Manchester LMC is the statutory representative and advisory body for over 500 GPs across 82 practices in Manchester. Our experienced team provides free, confidential advice on the full range of issues facing general practice — from complex regulatory matters to everyday employment and contractual questions. We do not judge; we listen and we help.
        </p>
        <p class="support-intro-sub">
          Whether you are facing a GMC investigation, a difficult partnership situation, a CQC visit, or simply need to talk something through, please do not hesitate to contact us. All enquiries are treated in strict confidence.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Confidence alert -->
      <div class="alert alert--info support-confidence-alert" role="note">
        {% icon "lock", 20 %}
        <span><strong>All calls and enquiries are treated in strict confidence.</strong> Manchester LMC will never share your details with your employer, the ICB, NHS England, or any other body without your explicit consent.</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Service Cards ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section--alt" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-10);">
        <h2 id="services-heading">Our Support Services</h2>
        <p>Click any service below to find out more, or call us directly on <a href="tel:01612238974" style="color: var(--colour-secondary); font-weight: 600;">0161 223 8974</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-2" style="gap: var(--space-6);">

        <!-- 1. Confidential Advisory Service -->
        <article class="service-card" id="confidential" aria-labelledby="card-confidential-heading">
          <div class="service-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            {% icon "lock", 28 %}
          </div>
          <h3 id="card-confidential-heading">Confidential Advisory Service</h3>
          <p>Facing a GMC investigation, fitness to practise referral, complaint, or suspension? Involved in a CQC inspection or partnership dispute? Our experienced advisors provide immediate, confidential guidance — free of charge and without judgement. If we're not the right people to help, we'll signpost you to someone who is.</p>
          <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: var(--space-4) 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2);">
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              GMC investigations &amp; fitness to practise
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              Patient complaints &amp; NHS ombudsman
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              Suspension &amp; immediate action cases
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              CQC inspections &amp; enforcement
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              Partnership disputes &amp; practice difficulties
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact/" class="service-card-link">
            Call us in confidence
            {% icon "arrow-right", 16 %}
          </a>
        </article>

        <!-- 2. Wellbeing Hub -->
        <article class="service-card" id="wellbeing" aria-labelledby="card-wellbeing-heading">
          <div class="service-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            {% icon "heart", 28 %}
          </div>
          <h3 id="card-wellbeing-heading">Wellbeing Hub</h3>
          <p>GP wellbeing is central to safe, sustainable patient care. Our Wellbeing Hub brings together mental health support, peer networks, free apps, crisis lines, and financial assistance resources — all in one place, specifically for healthcare professionals in Manchester.</p>
          <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: var(--space-4) 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2);">
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              NHS Practitioner Health &amp; BMA counselling
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              Peer support &amp; mentoring schemes
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              Free apps: Headspace, SilverCloud, Unmind
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              24/7 crisis support lines
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/support/wellbeing/" class="service-card-link">
            Visit the Wellbeing Hub
            {% icon "arrow-right", 16 %}
          </a>
        </article>

        <!-- 3. Practice Support -->
        <article class="service-card" id="practice-support" aria-labelledby="card-practice-heading">
          <div class="service-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            {% icon "home", 28 %}
          </div>
          <h3 id="card-practice-heading">Practice Support</h3>
          <p>Practical, expert guidance on the operational and legal challenges that practices face every day. We help you navigate employment law, HR matters, staff disciplinary issues, contracts, and policy implementation — saving you time and reducing risk.</p>
          <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: var(--space-4) 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2);">
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              Employment matters &amp; HR guidance
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              Staff disciplinary &amp; grievance processes
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              GMS/PMS contract interpretation
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              Policies, procedures &amp; templates
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact/" class="service-card-link">
            Get practice support
            {% icon "arrow-right", 16 %}
          </a>
        </article>

        <!-- 4. Breach Reporting -->
        <article class="service-card" id="breach-reporting" aria-labelledby="card-breach-heading">
          <div class="service-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            {% icon "alert-triangle", 28 %}
          </div>
          <h3 id="card-breach-heading">Breach Reporting</h3>
          <p>If your ICB, NHS England, or a local trust is failing to meet its contractual obligations to your practice, you have the right to formally report this. We will advise you on the process and support you throughout any escalation.</p>
          <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: var(--space-4) 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2);">
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              ICB contractual breaches
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              Trust &amp; secondary care failures
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
              {% icon "check", 14 %}
              Formal dispute escalation support
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/support/breach-report/" class="service-card-link">
            Report a breach
            {% icon "arrow-right", 16 %}
          </a>
        </article>

        <!-- 5. Cameron Fund -->
        <article class="service-card" id="cameron-fund" aria-labelledby="card-cameron-heading" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
          <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-6); align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 280px;">
              <div class="service-card-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-5);">
                {% icon "gift", 28 %}
              </div>
              <h3 id="card-cameron-heading">Cameron Fund</h3>
              <p>The Cameron Fund provides financial assistance to doctors and their families who are experiencing financial difficulty — whether due to illness, mental health difficulties, family crisis, or other hardship. Grants are means-tested and entirely confidential.</p>
              <p style="margin-top: var(--space-4); color: var(--colour-muted);">The Fund has supported doctors in need since 1970. Applications are straightforward and the team is supportive and discreet throughout the process.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; background-color: var(--colour-neutral); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: var(--space-6); min-width: 240px;">
              <p style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--colour-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Cameron Fund at a glance</p>
              <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 var(--space-5); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2);">
                <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
                  {% icon "check", 14 %}
                  Open to all registered GPs
                </li>
                <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
                  {% icon "check", 14 %}
                  Grants and interest-free loans
                </li>
                <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
                  {% icon "check", 14 %}
                  Strictly confidential process
                </li>
                <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--colour-muted);">
                  {% icon "check", 14 %}
                  No obligation application
                </li>
              </ul>
              <a
                href="https://www.cameronfund.org.uk"
                class="btn btn--primary"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                aria-label="Visit the Cameron Fund website (opens in new tab)">
                Visit Cameron Fund
                {% icon "external-link", 14 %}
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div><!-- /grid-2 -->
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Key Contact ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="key-contact-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;">

        <h2 id="key-contact-heading" class="visually-hidden">Key contact</h2>

        <!-- Highlighted contact box -->
        <div class="key-contact-box">
          <!-- Decorative circle -->
          <div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; width: 300px; height: 300px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%); top: -100px; right: -80px; pointer-events: none;"></div>

          <div style="position: relative; z-index: 1; display: flex; gap: var(--space-6); align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; width: 72px; height: 72px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--colour-white);" aria-hidden="true">NH</div>
            <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 220px;">
              <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--colour-accent-light); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Your first point of contact</p>
              <h3 style="color: var(--colour-white); margin-bottom: var(--space-1);">Nicola Holland</h3>
              <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); margin-bottom: var(--space-5);">Managing Director, Manchester LMC</p>
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-3);">
                <a href="tel:01612238974" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-size: 0.9375rem;" aria-label="Call Nicola Holland on 0161 223 8974">
                  {% icon "phone", 16 %}
                  0161 223 8974
                </a>
                <a href="mailto:nholland@manchesterlmc.co.uk" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-size: 0.9375rem;" aria-label="Email Nicola Holland">
                  {% icon "mail", 16 %}
                  nholland@manchesterlmc.co.uk
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
